{"t":"TXT","n":"Textron Inc.","nKo":"텍스트론","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":81.53,"chg":1.91,"chgPct":0.02399,"prev":79.62,"dayH":81.98,"dayL":79.81,"w52H":101.57,"w52L":71.87,"vol":1716682,"avgVol":1911700,"mcap":13811180544,"pe":14.66,"fpe":12.43,"eps":5.56,"feps":6.56,"pb":1.7,"div":0.08,"divY":0.001,"beta":0.88,"short":7309932,"shortPct":0.0502,"shortRatio":4.08,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Aerospace & Defense","iKo":"항공우주 및 방위","city":"Providence","emp":34000,"web":"https://www.textron.com","sum":"Textron Inc. operates in the aircraft, defense, industrial, and finance businesses worldwide. It operates in six segments: Textron Aviation, Bell, Textron Systems, Industrial, Textron eAviation, and Finance. The Textron Aviation segment manufactures, sells, and services business jets, turboprop and piston engine aircraft, and military trainer and defense aircraft, as well as offers maintenance, inspection, and repair services; commercial parts; and advanced flight training devices. The Bell segment supplies military and commercial helicopters, tiltrotor aircraft, and related spare parts and services. The Textron Systems segment offers unmanned aircraft systems, electronic systems and solutions, advanced marine crafts, piston aircraft engines, live military air-to-air and air-to-ship traini","sumKo":"Textron Inc.는 전 세계적으로 항공기, 방위산업, 산업 및 금융 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. Textron Aviation, Bell, Textron Systems, Industrial, Textron eAviation 및 Finance의 6개 부문으로 운영됩니다. Textron Aviation 부문은 비즈니스 제트기, 터보프롭 및 피스톤 엔진 항공기, 군용 훈련기 및 방위 항공기를 제조, 판매 및 서비스할 뿐만 아니라 유지보수, 검사 및 수리 서비스도 제공합니다. 상업용 부품; 및 고급 비행 훈련 장치. Bell 부문은 군용 및 상업용 헬리콥터, 틸트로터 항공기, 관련 예비 부품 및 서비스를 공급합니다. Textron 시스템 부문은 무인 항공기 시스템, 전자 시스템 및 솔루션, 첨단 해양 공예, 피스톤 항공기 엔진, 실제 군사 공대공 및 공대함 훈련을 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":12869000000,"ni":861000000},{"y":2023,"rev":13683000000,"ni":921000000},{"y":2024,"rev":13702000000,"ni":824000000},{"y":2025,"rev":14799000000,"ni":921000000}],"quart